zoterocitation-settings-section-governance = Collections & Tag Governance
zoterocitation-settings-enable = Enable CiteFlow citation tracking
zoterocitation-settings-enable-help = Controls Word integration hooks, active session binding, and citation data synchronization. Restart Zotero after changing this option. This settings pane remains available.
zoterocitation-settings-drag-cite = Enable drag citation
zoterocitation-settings-drag-help = Drag selected items into Word to insert standard CSL citations at the cursor. Takes effect immediately; works even when the citation column is hidden.
zoterocitation-settings-collections = Create temporary Word collections in tree
zoterocitation-settings-collections-help = Maintains a temporary collection for each active Word document positioned immediately above “My Publications”. Disabling this cleans up plugin-managed collections.
zoterocitation-settings-citation-tags = Automatically tag cited items
zoterocitation-settings-citation-tags-help = Maintain tags on personal-library items cited in current Word documents. Turning this off removes tags added by CiteFlow and preserves pre-existing manual tags.
zoterocitation-settings-tag-text = Citation tag text
zoterocitation-settings-tag-text-help = Defaults to /Citations. Use any nonempty text of 1–200 characters, such as “Cited”. Renaming migrates plugin-managed tags and preserves other tags.
zoterocitation-settings-invalid-tag = Tag text not saved. Enter 1–200 characters without line breaks or control characters.
zoterocitation-settings-save-failed = Settings could not be saved. Controls show the actual saved values. Please retry.
zoterocitation-settings-apply-failed = Settings saved, but some changes could not be applied. Tag ownership is retained after write failures or on read-only items. Check the Zotero error log and retry.
zoterocitation-settings-performance = Refresh and performance
zoterocitation-settings-performance-help = All values use milliseconds (ms). Changes apply to subsequent refreshes and statistics; already queued tasks keep their scheduled timing.
zoterocitation-settings-tag-delay = Citation tag sync delay (0–2000 ms)
zoterocitation-settings-view-delay = Item list refresh delay (0–2000 ms)
zoterocitation-settings-health-window = Diagnostic time window (10000–3600000 ms)
zoterocitation-settings-slow-threshold = Slow operation threshold (5–5000 ms)
zoterocitation-settings-diagnostics = Diagnostics & Maintenance
zoterocitation-settings-debug = Enable debug logging
zoterocitation-settings-debug-help = Record CiteFlow activity in Zotero debug output. Takes effect immediately; keep disabled for everyday use.
zoterocitation-settings-reset = Restore defaults
zoterocitation-settings-saved = Settings saved automatically.
zoterocitation-settings-restart = Settings saved. Restart Zotero to apply the enabled state.
zoterocitation-settings-invalid = Value not saved. Enter an integer between { $min } and { $max }.
